s_passages","count_explanation":"2處獨立位置，2個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu044-lu-rendered-oldcapture"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"jza_i0b_kpb","surname":"黃","ming":null,"additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p007","quote":"及乂死，穎表志為中書監，留鄴，參署相府事。乘與敗于蕩陰，穎遣志督兵迎帝。及王浚攻鄴，志勸穎奉天子還洛陽。時甲士尚萬五千人，志夜部分，至曉，眾皆成列，而程太妃戀鄴不欲去，穎未能決。俄而眾潰，唯志與子謐、兄子綝、殿中武賁千人而已，志復勸穎早發。時有道士姓黃，號曰聖人，太妃信之。及使呼人，道士求兩杯酒，飲訖，拋杯而去，於是志計始決。而人馬復散，志于營陣間尋索，得數乘鹿車，司馬督韓玄收集黃門，得百餘人。志入，帝問志曰：「何故散敗至此？」志曰：「賊去鄴尚八十里，而人士一朝駭散，太弟今欲奉陛下還洛陽。」帝曰：「甚佳。」於是禦犢車便發。屯騎校尉郝昌先領兵八千守洛陽，帝召之，至汲郡而昌至，兵仗甚盛。志喜於復振，啟天子宜下赦書，與百姓同其休慶。既達洛陽，志啟以滿奮為司隸校尉。奔散者多還，百官粗備，帝悅，賜志絹二百匹、綿百斤、衣一襲、鶴綾袍一領。","note":"本段具名/明姓；名未知留空，不將爵號或親屬稱謂塞入姓名。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"hao":"聖人","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","source_id":"s-jinshu044-lu-rendered-oldcapture"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p007:m0125","start":125,"end":126,"surface":"黃","kind":"person","person_id":"jza_i0b_kpb","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本篇來源內具名角色；跨篇同指未作肯定。身份審讀：huang。","source_identity_role":"huang","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#huang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p007","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin